# Whitelist strategy: ignore everything, then re-include the synchronized support files.
# Runtime state, caches, credentials, plugin deps, and machine-specific config
# (opencode.jsonc / opencode.json) must never be committed — the real config is
# reconstructed per machine by install.ps1 from templates/opencode.jsonc
# (additive merge: missing system keys are filled, existing values never touched).
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/templates/
